# Vendored third-party source. Formatted upstream (Mutable Instruments house
# style, 2-space indent) and deliberately kept byte-identical so that
# re-vendoring is a copy rather than a merge. Reformatting it to Deluge style
# would make every future upstream diff unreadable.
#
# Note the CI format check (.github/workflows/format-check.yml) only looks at
# c,cpp,h,hpp -- the .cc files here are already skipped by extension. This entry
# is what covers the ~90 vendored .h files.
src/deluge/dsp/plaits/**
src/deluge/dsp/clouds/**
src/deluge/dsp/stmlib/**
src/deluge/dsp/dx/**

